    "content": [
      {
        "heading": {
          "text": "A Greeting from the Elder",
          "foot": { "type": "xrf", "content": { "bibleLink": "3 John 1:1–4" } }
        }
      },
      { "paragraph": true, "text": "The elder," },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth—and not I alone, but also all who know the truth—"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 2,
    "content": "because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:"
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 3,
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from the Lord Jesus Christ,",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "CT" },
            " ",
            { "text": "and from Jesus Christ", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 4,
    "content": [
      {
        "heading": {
          "text": "Walking in the Truth",
          "foot": { "type": "xrf", "content": { "bibleLink": "John 8:30–47" } }
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 5,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "And now I urge you, dear lady—not as a new commandment to you,",
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Literally ",
            {
              "text": "not as a new commandment I am writing to you",
              "marks": ["i"]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      " but one we have had from the beginning—that we love one another."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 6,
    "content": "And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love."
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 7,
    "content": [
      { "heading": "Beware of Deceivers" },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "For many deceivers have entered",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "CT" },
            " ",
            { "text": "have gone out", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person is the deceiver and the antichrist."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 8,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for,",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "TH" },
            ", ",
            { "abbr": "NE" },
            ", and ",
            { "abbr": "WH" },
            " ",
            { "text": "what you have worked for", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " but that you may be fully rewarded."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 9,
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "Anyone who transgresses",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "CT" },
            " ",
            { "text": "runs ahead", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "text": " without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in the teaching of Christ",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "CT" },
            " ",
            { "text": "in His teaching", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " has both the Father and the Son."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 10,
    "content": {
      "paragraph": true,
      "text": "If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him."
    }
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 11,
    "content": "Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds."
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 12,
    "content": [
      {
        "heading": {
          "text": "Conclusion",
          "foot": {
            "type": "xrf",
            "content": { "bibleLink": "3 John 1:13–14" }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": true,
        "text": "I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face,",
        "foot": {
          "type": "trn",
          "content": [
            "Literally ",
            { "text": "mouth to mouth", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "text": " so that our",
        "foot": {
          "type": "var",
          "content": [
            { "abbr": "SBL" },
            " and ",
            { "abbr": "WH" },
            " ",
            { "text": "your", "marks": ["i"] }
          ]
        }
      },
      " joy may be complete."
    ]
  },
  {
    "book": "2JN",
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 13,
    "content": {
      "paragraph": true,
      "text": "The children of your elect sister send you greetings. Amen.",
      "foot": {
        "type": "var",
        "content": [
          { "abbr": "CT" },
          " does not include ",
          { "text": "Amen.", "marks": ["i"] }
        ]
